      "message": "test(ui): re-render egui_app_light and egui_tool_editor on Windows\n\nPR #58 committed both goldens rendered on another platform. On Windows,\nwhere every gate tier runs, they differed only by anti-aliasing noise:\n5,248 / 7,145 pixels under threshold 0.4, 1 / 4 pixels past 0.6, none\npast 1.0; the diff image shows isolated pixels and no layout change.\nRe-rendered with UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1; camcraft-ui lib 217 passed.\n\nFixes #66\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
